Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,有人持刀！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,能刺，也得躲刀。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,下次先叫我关门。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:17.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,六百铜。桩过白线才付，我出两个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:24.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,两天工钱。帮我看水。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:27.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,喊了你听？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.78,0:00:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,听。
